ObservationEvent (environment)
  Tool: finish
  Result: Fixed the bug in SlidingWindowConversationManager.reduce_context where it failed to trim tool-heavy conversations after v1.35.0 due to skipping all assistant messages and user messages containing tool results as trim points. Added fallback trimming at an assistant(toolUse) + user(toolResult) boundary to handle these cases. Created and ran a new test that verifies this fallback trimming behavior, which passed successfully. The existing coverage test for the overflow exception also passes, confirm...
